PHASE 12 — Academy Partner Portal

Goal:
Build academy partner area for submitting and tracking student briefs.

Pages:
- /academy/dashboard
- /academy/briefs
- /academy/briefs/new
- /academy/briefs/[id]
- /owner/academy-briefs
- /owner/academy-briefs/[id]

Brief fields:
- Student name
- Age
- Nationality/country
- Current Arabic level
- Goal
- Speaking ability
- Reading/writing ability
- Notes from academy
- Parent/contact info if child
- Preferred schedule if known

Statuses:
- submitted
- under_review
- converted_to_student
- rejected

Owner can:
- Review brief
- Add internal notes
- Convert to onboarding/student
- Link created student ID

Acceptance criteria:
- Academy partner submits brief.
- Academy partner sees only own briefs.
- Owner sees all briefs.
- Owner can convert brief.
- Audit log records conversion.

Manual test checklist:
- Submit brief as academy.
- Review as Owner.
- Convert to student/onboarding.
- Confirm academy sees status update.

Stop condition:
Stop here. Test this phase before continuing.
